{"type":"message","id":"369cbffc","parentId":"f9693827","timestamp":"2026-04-17T23:11:57.442Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a good picture. Let me update the heartbeat state, check for any tasks that haven't been updated in over 60 minutes, and prepare a progress report. The tasks I need to do:\n\n1. Check task board - Done (1 task in the list: \"填写天津瑞湾每周核心关注事项表\")\n2. Update last heartbeat time - Need to do\n3. Mark tasks with no update in 60+ minutes as Dead - The task \"填写天津瑞湾每周核心关注事项表\" was due on 2026-04-17 12:00 (timestamp 1775368800000), and the task's last update was... I don't have update time. Let me check if there are any tasks that are stale.\n\n\n4. The task in the tasklist has a due date of 1775368800000, which is 2026-04-17 12:00 Beijing time - that deadline has already passed since it's now 2026-04-17 23:11 Beijing time, so I need to check the AI协作表 for any stale tasks that haven't been updated recently.\n\nLooking at the AI协作表, all six tasks show \"待执行\" status and all have the same update timestamp of 1775477000000, which converts to 2026-04-04 06:56 Beijing time - that's nearly two weeks old, not 60+ minutes, so they're not actually stale. I'm seeing that all the AI tasks in the list have a timestamp of 1775477000000, which corresponds to April 4, 2026 - but today's date is April 17, 2026, so these records haven't been updated in about 13 days. This could mean they're either stuck tasks or the update mechanism isn't working properly.\n\nLooking at the AI协作表 from the shared pool, it seems the \"更新时间\" field might be showing when the table structure was last modified rather than the actual record updates, so I need to investigate whether these tasks are genuinely inactive or if there's something else going on with how the data's being tracked.\n\nThe main task I need to focus on is the one with the due date of April 17, 2026 - that's already passed since it's currently April 17 at 23:11 Beijing time. I should check if there's an \"更新时间\" field on this task in Feishu's task system to determine if it's been abandoned, but I don't have a direct way to access that metadata through the available tools.\n\nLooking at the bitable tables, the AI协作表 shows all records were last updated around April 4, which is 13+ days old, and the 多龙虾协作分工表 has similar timestamps. The tasks themselves appear to be in a \"待执行\" state, which doesn't necessarily mean they're dead. Since the cron job runs every hour but the task update times are much older, this suggests either the tasks were created with old timestamps or there's a data synchronization issue with the bitable records themselves.\n\nLet me update the heartbeat state and add a progress record to the bitable to document this check."},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me update the heartbeat state and check the project progress table for the latest entries.\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1f8l70a3patx_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/heartbeat-state.json"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776467502207,"responseId":"0631f12e6949c62e47ec2c16b40c57e6"}}
